and $\|c(z_{\epsilon_1})\|\le1$ that $\|c(x)\|\le1+\|\tilde{c}(x)\|$. This together with the above inequalities and \eqref{nearly-feas-level-set} implies $x\in\cS(\delta_{f},\delta_{c})$. Hence, statement (i) of Lemma \ref{lem:level-set-augmented-lagrangian-func} holds.

